 /*
+ * On-board A/B instrument for the HEVC shapes still open on the bench:
+ *   BIT(9)  write VDM+0x98 (PRC_CACHE_TYPE) = 2, as the vendor does for HEVC
+ *   BIT(10) use the HEVC timeout constant instead of the one the other codecs
+ *           use, which is what the vendor sets for HEVC
+ *   BIT(15) pad the CTB grid by one row (single-CTB-row bottom-line probe)
+ *   BIT(16) lift the tile refusal and put the raster-scan address into the
+ *           slice words that carry one (D8/D9/D43)
+ *   BIT(17) with BIT(16), also write the slice's own tile address into D6
